data.clauses = [
  {"number":"01","title":"BOOKING, PACKAGE DOCUMENTS AND ORDER OF PRECEDENCE","body":"Your contract with Rarecation Travel comprises, where applicable: (a) the booking confirmation; (b) the itinerary and inclusions/exclusions; (c) the quotation or invoice; (d) the payment schedule; (e) any package-specific terms disclosed before or at booking; and (f) these Terms & Conditions.If there is any inconsistency, mandatory Malaysian law and regulatory requirements prevail first. Thereafter, the booking confirmation and package-specific written terms prevail to the extent of the specific booking, followed by the remaining documents. Nothing in this clause permits Rarecation Travel to reduce or avoid a right or remedy that cannot lawfully be excluded."},

                 {"number":"02","title":"Pricing & Payments","body":"Prices are quoted in the currency stated at the time of booking and may include taxes, fees, and supplier charges where specified. Payment dates and amounts will be shown in your booking confirmation. Late payment may affect your reservation."},{"number":"03","title":"Changes & Cancellations","body":"Requests to change or cancel a booking must be made through Rarecation. Charges may apply depending on the fare, accommodation, cruise line, or other supplier conditions attached to your itinerary."},{"number":"04","title":"Travel Documents & Insurance","body":"You are responsible for holding valid passports, visas, health documentation, and any other documents required for your journey. We strongly recommend travel insurance that covers cancellation, medical needs, and personal belongings."},{"number":"05","title":"Supplier Terms","body":"Cruise lines, hotels, airlines, and other travel suppliers provide services under their own terms and conditions. Those terms may apply in addition to these Terms & Conditions and can affect changes, cancellations, and service delivery."},{"number":"06","title":"Liability","body":"Rarecation acts as a travel arranger for services provided by independent suppliers. To the extent permitted by applicable law, Rarecation is not responsible for events outside its reasonable control or for the acts and omissions of suppliers."},{"number":"07","title":"Guest Conduct","body":"Guests must comply with reasonable instructions from travel providers and respect local laws, safety requirements, and fellow travellers. Serious misconduct may result in services being withdrawn without refund."},{"number":"08","title":"Contact Us","body":"If you have a question about your booking or these Terms & Conditions, please contact the Rarecation travel team through your traveller portal before you travel."}]